    "group": "Brôkhyr Iron-master",
    "summary": "As your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) ends, the Iron-master’s unit can select a single friendly unit at most 3″ away. Its eligible targets are **EXOFRAME**, **IRONKIN STEELJACKS**, and **LEAGUES OF VOTANN VEHICLE** units. One of its models can recover as many as D3 wounds it lost. The cap becomes 3 with an Ironkin Assistant in the Iron-master’s unit. A unit can receive this selection just once that turn.",
